    {
      "text": "Each time it hops, it makes a ringing sound. It deafens foes by emitting high-frequency cries.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is an orb inside its mouth. When it hops, the orb bounces all over and makes a ringing sound.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon gave me an excruciating headache when it seemingly cried out without making a sound. Perhaps there are some sounds that the human ear is simply incapable of hearing.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
